      "blockers": [
        "effect instructions do not carry a universal typed zone-applicability predicate",
        "the Oracle compiler does not prove every clear off-battlefield instruction scope",
        "no cross-family test establishes the battlefield default without overexposing hidden-zone objects"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Individual operations select specific zones, but that is not evidence for the universal CR 609.2 default."
      ]
    },
