      "blockers": [
        "partial completion is implemented separately by individual operations rather than a universal typed instruction executor",
        "compound effects do not all distinguish impossible instructions from material semantic uncertainty",
        "the Oracle compiler cannot yet prove that every remaining instruction is attempted in order"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "Prevention safely clamps to the remaining damage, but this witness cannot promote the general do-as-much-as-possible rule."
      ]
