      "blockers": [
        "there is no authoritative candidate generator for every permitted damage-source category",
        "source choice is not captured at effect creation with zone-change continuity",
        "permanent-spell to resolved-permanent identity continuity is not represented for source shields",
        "last-known objects and command-zone choices are not integrated with the effect registry"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "The primitive consumes already-supplied source properties and does not pretend to implement legal source selection."
      ]
    },
