      "blockers": [
        "static source-property effects are not continuously registered from authoritative battlefield semantics",
        "off-battlefield source characteristics are not universally derived",
        "source types, colors, and other properties are not evaluated through the continuous layer system for every damage event"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "A supplied static primitive can independently match multiple events, but active-effect discovery and authoritative source evaluation remain incomplete."
